  "content": "<p data-pid=\"qGs5WcDC\">《幽灵中的机器》的第一章<span class=\"nolink\">《演化的简单数学》</span>旨在传达我们的遗传历史、当下的生物学状态与终极追求之间的冲突与分歧。为此，我们需要进行比面向非生物学家的演化论入门更深入的探讨——那些入门通常只停留在自然选择的表象层面。</p><p data-pid=\"yYp2bhzG\">—Rob Bensinger, <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Minds-An-Introduction\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Minds: An Introduction</a><sup data-text=\"心智：导读\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2016579299948393369\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"1\">[1]</sup></p><hr/><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2017209895406035933\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"一位陌生的神祇\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4ccc597e964d0f9b0f2de61e9992b429.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">一位陌生的神祇</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2017932223110735828\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"进化的奇迹\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-57ba5f184f4201f3525f92f6929f67ec.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">进化的奇迹</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2018382533511882216\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"进化很蠢（但确实有效）\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0f96abf5f3ea6d173e93f1d1ac55ae88.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">进化很蠢（但确实有效）</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2020575295015503855\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"公司与纳米器件不会进化\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f923ba2e63fcea5759490662a5258923.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">公司与纳米器件不会进化</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2023118761268364628\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"进化之路，通向灭绝\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-227aec49e764604f80a7d4c89a1fdb5f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">进化之路，通向灭绝</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2023475345806958868\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"群体选择主义的悲剧\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6aaa2fddd5959d59e0f267ab19de75f6.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">群体选择主义的悲剧</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2023844708217037671\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"虚假的优化标准\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-02a3c3c13c20d9ddde5ad6dff1a87121.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">虚假的优化标准</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2024140315104134225\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"适者生存，而非“最”者生存\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-dfe243f825382511f9220bb45d53d7a5.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">适者生存，而非“最”者生存</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2025180672604554190\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"进化心理学\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ec405a9fbab526ff4ceb1683d9f71885.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">进化心理学</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2033335814097258310\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"一项尤为优雅的进化心理学实验\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cdd22033fa4ad6ed6dabbb75de3ede2b.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">一项尤为优雅的进化心理学实验</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2033339338453423814\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"超常刺激与西方文明的崩溃\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8a171294af8b562ebc38f1217f2b1692.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">超常刺激与西方文明的崩溃</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2033339867837494056\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"尔为神碎\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-60ada56dc27cc1c1ada603eab67853cd.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">尔为神碎</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"J7j45v6K\">上一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2016924742712574096\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"智能之力\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-94c29e652ceb31f4df96fcf19baf3c48.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">智能之力</a><p data-pid=\"ePXoUDpS\">下一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2017209895406035933\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"一位陌生的神祇\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-4ccc597e964d0f9b0f2de61e9992b429.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">一位陌生的神祇</a><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"VssY-9-e\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/The-Simple-Math-Of-Evolution-Sequence\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">The Simple Math of Evolution - Sequence</a></blockquote>",
